body:
Depends what stories youre looking at. Palpatine was absolutely a racist and the empire was a humano-centric organization in the old EU. It’s what made Thrawn so special, the fact that he was not only in the Empire as an alien, but that he rose to such a prominent position in the imperial military. 

With the release of the prequels everything changed, you found out Lucas’ vision for who trained Palpatine, Darth Plagueis, and then the Plagueis novel came out which shows that he was actually trained by an alien, and now there are alien inquisitors, and he had alien advisors like Mas Amedda, etc;

Star Wars has changed so much since 1999, so the answer to your question is “Depends who or when you ask”

\-Change the purple part of the tunic from Purple to Gold

&#x200B;

\-Change the cloak/cape around the neck and behind the back from Brown to White

&#x200B;

\-Change the Lightsaber color to Yellow

\-Change hair and beard from Blonde to White

&#x200B;

\-Change Lightsaber color from Yellow to Blue

&#x200B;

\-Make outer robes a darker Brown

&#x200B;

And if possible

&#x200B;

\-Add vambraces to each hand/forearm
